<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<style>
    body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }
</style>
<body class="bg-white text-slate-800 antialiased m-0 p-0">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="pt-16 pb-12 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <span class="text-red-600 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs">Careers</span>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-tight tracking-tight mt-2 mb-4 text-slate-900">
                Help us build the <br>future of infrastructure.
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-slate-500 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed font-light">
                At solanki, working is not just employment—it is a philosophy. We are looking for innovators ready to discover their true mettle.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 bg-slate-50 px-6 border-y border-slate-100">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-red-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Our Philosophy</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div>
                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed italic">
                        "Success is not a destination but a journey."
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                        When a professional joins solanki Limited, they aren't just taking a job. They are embarking on a path of self-discovery.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">More than Employment</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">We don't just generate jobs; we spark a revolution for personal betterment.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Perennial Growth</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Our doors are always open for highly qualified, adaptable talents.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-12 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Open Positions</h2>
            
            <div class="divide-y divide-slate-200">
                <a href="mailto:hrd@solanki.com" class="group py-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all duration-300 -mx-4 px-4 rounded-lg">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-red-600 transition-colors">Senior Civil Engineer</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Full-time • Remote / Site-based</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-slate-900">
                        View Position 
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a href="mailto:hrd@solanki.com" class="group py-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all duration-300 -mx-4 px-4 rounded-lg">
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-red-600 transition-colors">Logistics Coordinator</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-1">Full-time • Mumbai, MH</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-4 md:mt-0 flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 group-hover:text-slate-900">
                        View Position 
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-10 p-8 border border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-2xl text-center bg-white shadow-sm">
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Join the Solanki Pipes Revolution</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 mb-6 max-w-lg mx-auto">
                    Don't see a specific role? Share your journey with us.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
                    <a href="mailto:hrd@solanki.com" class="inline-block px-10 py-3 bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-red-600 transition-all">
                        Drop your Resume
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>